{"title":"Cyprus Juniors Team Selection Tests","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p><b>Cyprus Juniors Team Selection Tests</b>are considered the four parts of the <b>Selection Competition under 15.5</b> and are called <i>\"<a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Euclid\" title=\"Euclid\">Efklidis</a>\"</i>. All the student have the same test. In each of the competition 5 students are eliminated. So after the 4th test the six member of national team for <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Junior_Balkan_Mathematical_Olympiad\" title=\"Junior Balkan Mathematical Olympiad\">Junior BMO</a> and the four runners-up are selected.\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Resources\">Resources</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Cyprus_Juniors_Team_Selection_Tests&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Resources\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Cyprus_Juniors_TST_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"Cyprus Juniors TST Problems and Solutions\">Cyprus Juniors TST Problems and Solutions</a> -- A community effort to provide solutions to all Cyprus Juniors TST problems from which students can learn.</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Cyprus_Juniors_Team_Selection_Tests&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Cyprus_mathematics_competitions\" title=\"Cyprus mathematics competitions\">Cyprus mathematics competitions</a></li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018082016\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.006 seconds\nReal time u